<title>USA: King World executives cut stake in company.</title>
<headline>King World executives cut stake in company.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four executives of King World Productions  Inc, including the chairman of the board and the president, said Friday they have reduced their stake in the company to 21.8 percent or the equivalent of 8,150,156 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold more than 350,000 shares of the New York-based feature film and television production company between Feb. 21 and March 11 at $37.14 to $38.54 a share.</p>
</text>
